      "instance_name": "toxicity_1",
      "label": "Harmful",
      "description": "The meme trivializes the suffering of Holocaust victims by suggesting their happiness is a virtue or coping mechanism, ignoring the horrific context of their imprisonment. It promotes a superficial message of optimism while distorting historical reality, which can be psychologically damaging and offensive to survivors and their descendants.",
