      "instance_name": "audience_id",
      "label": "general internet audience",
      "description": "The meme is designed for a broad online audience, likely individuals who consume and share internet memes without specific cultural or historical context. The target community includes those who may not be aware of the Holocaust or the historical significance of the image, and who might interpret the juxtaposition of smiling prisoners with the text 'you can be happy and smiling in any situation' as a motivational or inspirational message about resilience and positivity. The meme's harmful intent targets those who are not critically aware of the historical context, potentially normalizing or trivializing the suffering of Holocaust victims.",
